Decodes a percent sign only when two hex digits follow it, and keeps any other
percent sign as literal text, as the WHATWG URL Standard does. A file, asset,
or mbtiles URL with a bare percent sign otherwise names a different path, with
garbage or NUL bytes in it
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1435).
Upstream: not proposed

